                "textId": "Performance_432801_1527520929_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "{A点头}在花园办一场“睡衣派对”，对嘛~？\n我提前做好功课，果然是对的。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_432801_1527520929_content",
                "value": "{A点头}在花园办一场“睡衣派对”，对嘛~？\n我提前做好功课，果然是对的。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
